1
00:00:00,035 --> 00:00:03,375
(Sheldon:)...this so-called City of Roses...

2
00:00:03,539 --> 00:00:08,039
...and it haunts me. Ah! The injustice.

3
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:13,720
(Sheldon:)I lie here awake, tormented,
while out there, evil lurks...

4
00:00:13,882 --> 00:00:18,552
...probably playing "Donkey Kong"
on my classic Nintendo.

5
00:00:20,514 --> 00:00:21,554
[CLATTERING]

6
00:00:37,573 --> 00:00:39,573
[MUMBLES]

7
00:00:49,585 --> 00:00:51,255
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear.

8
00:00:53,464 --> 00:01:12,034
(Sheldon:)I am the master of my own bladder.

